{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/886015-size-and-speed-in-chrod","id":886015,"title":"Size and Speed in ChroD","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-05-09T00:54:27-07:00","id":886015,"title":"Size and Speed in ChroD","content":"I see some old posts from the very early days of 2E indicating that, at some point, Size was going to replace Species factor for speed. The books have always been kind of vague on this point, especially if you examine stat blocks of antagonists closely. Merits that increase size never mention granting extra speed.<br /> <br /> Can anyone point me to current, published Second Edition material that equates the two?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-09T01:23:42-07:00","id":886022,"title":"","content":"I don't think Size was ever going to replace Species factor. There was some stuff that equated the two, but I think most of it has been errataed out by now. IIRC it was in VtR 2e or CofD 2e core's book in the character creation section where this equating happened.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-09T03:20:27-07:00","id":886072,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/886015-size-and-speed-in-chrod?p=886022#post886022\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't think Size was ever going to replace Species factor. There was some stuff that equated the two, but I think most of it has been errataed out by now. IIRC it was in VtR 2e or CofD 2e core's book in the character creation section where this equating happened.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks for the quick response! Most of the mentions I found were for early Vampire. Good to know that it's since been errata'd.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}